{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-07-19 11:00:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM REMINDS SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES ON THEIR INVESTMENT IN WELLS FARGO & COMPANY OF CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE - WFC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JULY 19, 2022) - POMERANTZ LLP ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ("WELLS FARGO" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: WFC) AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS. THE CLASS ACTION, FILED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE NORTHERN DISTRICT OF CALIFORNIA, AND DOCKETED UNDER 22-CV-03811, IS ON BEHALF OF A CLASS CONSISTING OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES OTHER THAN DEFENDANTS...'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-07-19 05:45:00', 'title': 'WFC ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF AUGUST 29, 2022 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JULY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF PERSONS AND ENTITIES THAT PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED WELLS FARGO COMMON STOCK BETWEEN FEBRUARY 24, 2021 AND JUNE 9, 2022.LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: AUGUST 29, 2022 NO OBLIGATION OR COST TO YOU.'}